WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 33]

01:40.230 --> 01:40.690
Changhe,

01:41.760 --> 01:43.490
why must we work with them?

01:44.150 --> 01:45.050
If we had stepped in

01:45.120 --> 01:46.050
in time last night,

01:46.430 --> 01:47.540
Muyu might not

01:47.560 --> 01:48.690
have been hurt that badly.

01:49.230 --> 01:50.050
You're questioning me?

01:58.200 --> 01:59.290
Your decision

02:01.200 --> 02:02.210
must have your reasons.

02:14.120 --> 02:14.820
Go tell Dian Ye

02:15.750 --> 02:16.780
my cooperation with them

02:16.800 --> 02:17.940
is limited to helping them

02:18.030 --> 02:19.100
take on the Prince of Langya.

02:19.870 --> 02:20.690
When I leave seclusion,

02:20.710 --> 02:21.780
everything will be decided.

02:22.910 --> 02:23.850
Tell them they'd better...

02:26.520 --> 02:27.380
not act rashly.

02:29.080 --> 02:30.010
Understood.

02:35.710 --> 02:36.220
Go.

03:40.030 --> 03:41.100
Something big happened.

03:44.190 --> 03:45.380
Your Highness, Deputy General He seeks audience.

03:45.400 --> 03:46.410
Your Highness, urgent report!

03:50.030 --> 03:50.540
Speak.

03:51.000 --> 03:51.660
From your look,

03:52.120 --> 03:52.890
it's definitely not the kind

03:52.910 --> 03:54.170
of news you want heard.

03:54.910 --> 03:56.370
When General Lei struck Nanxu City,

03:56.400 --> 03:57.130
he was ambushed.

03:57.630 --> 03:59.130
Then he led a small squad to break out,

03:59.520 --> 04:00.940
and is now fleeing to Mount Luolei.

04:01.400 --> 04:02.660
We do have some troops there,

04:03.130 --> 04:04.690
but if Nanjue is set on sealing the mountain,

04:04.870 --> 04:05.290
I'm afraid...

04:06.230 --> 04:07.100
No reinforcements?

04:08.630 --> 04:10.100
All tied down by Nanjue's main force.

04:10.870 --> 04:12.060
They've gone all out,

04:12.240 --> 04:13.170
willing to pay any price,

04:13.560 --> 04:14.730
just to take down our commander.

04:20.160 --> 04:21.050
Mount Luolei...

04:23.600 --> 04:24.020
Your Highness.

04:31.630 --> 04:32.220
Go.

04:33.750 --> 04:34.460
Bring him back.

04:37.560 --> 04:39.290
Undercurrents run deep in Tianqi City,

04:39.680 --> 04:41.020
how can I leave now?

04:41.390 --> 04:42.190
I'll be fine.

04:42.950 --> 04:43.700
In Tianqi City,

04:43.950 --> 04:45.410
no one can threaten me.

04:46.600 --> 04:47.340
I just hate

04:48.070 --> 04:49.050
that this time I can't...

04:50.600 --> 04:50.980
Your Highness!

04:54.510 --> 04:55.540
Where is Ji Ruofeng?

04:56.000 --> 04:56.850
Why isn't he back yet?

04:59.630 --> 05:00.820
He took Chuhe

05:01.160 --> 05:02.660
to the Miao Territory to find Dragonfire Herb

05:03.040 --> 05:03.850
and Cinnabar Spiders.

05:04.920 --> 05:06.370
He found clues in ancient texts.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.140
Taken together,

05:08.830 --> 05:10.610
they can suppress the frost poison in me.

05:15.430 --> 05:16.220
I keep feeling

05:17.310 --> 05:19.460
someone's deliberately moving your people away.

05:19.680 --> 05:20.660
Xinyue,

05:21.560 --> 05:22.250
right now,

05:22.560 --> 05:23.900
every extra word you say

05:24.560 --> 05:25.250
could well become

05:25.800 --> 05:27.340
a lifelong regret.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.050
But, Your Highness...

05:32.070 --> 05:32.930
In this world,

05:33.680 --> 05:34.340
everyone

05:34.870 --> 05:35.490
has something

05:35.510 --> 05:37.020
we absolutely cannot lose.

05:37.510 --> 05:37.980
I have it.

05:38.480 --> 05:39.100
You do too.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.220
When the worst

05:41.750 --> 05:43.220
inevitably comes,

05:44.000 --> 05:44.410
then...

05:46.190 --> 05:47.290
cast everything aside.

05:56.120 --> 05:56.660
I'm sorry,

05:57.560 --> 05:57.980
Your Highness.

06:32.510 --> 06:32.900
Your Highness.

06:35.070 --> 06:36.170
Something major happened

06:37.000 --> 06:38.100
in Tianqi City last night.

06:39.160 --> 06:40.220
Su Muyu fought Nanjue's Blade Ghost,

06:40.310 --> 06:41.170
Xu Liuyun.

06:41.870 --> 06:42.700
Xu Liuyun was killed.

06:43.680 --> 06:44.580
As for Su Muyu's side,

06:45.240 --> 06:46.170
that young physician Bai Hehuai

06:46.270 --> 06:47.460
from Medicine King Valley

06:47.720 --> 06:48.900
seems to have met with misfortune.

06:49.950 --> 06:50.700
After that, Su Muyu stormed

06:50.720 --> 06:51.780
the Flying Tiger General's residence,

06:52.630 --> 06:54.050
even drawing in the Jinwu Guards.

06:54.750 --> 06:55.810
Now He-Yu Clinic

06:56.360 --> 06:57.250
stands emptied out.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.100
As for the exact cause,

06:59.800 --> 07:00.490
I don't yet know.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.290
You'll know soon.

07:09.830 --> 07:10.730
Mu Qingyang of the Mu family

07:11.160 --> 07:11.930
pays respects to Your Highness

07:13.000 --> 07:13.610
and Xuanwu Guardian.

07:15.000 --> 07:15.540
Have a seat.

07:21.190 --> 07:21.660
Looks like

07:22.360 --> 07:23.290
Your Highness was not surprised

07:23.630 --> 07:24.410
by my arrival.

07:25.040 --> 07:25.780
About last night,

07:26.390 --> 07:27.140
Lianyue told me.

07:28.800 --> 07:29.730
The miracle physician...

07:32.430 --> 07:33.020
She's alive.

07:33.920 --> 07:34.410
That's good.

07:35.750 --> 07:36.580
Not entirely.

07:37.480 --> 07:38.020
Right now,

07:38.270 --> 07:39.340
our Patriarch of Blood River

07:39.480 --> 07:40.250
is in seclusion.

07:40.600 --> 07:41.980
One family head is badly hurt.

07:42.560 --> 07:43.290
Another

07:43.720 --> 07:44.540
is far away in Blood River.

07:45.560 --> 07:46.580
And the last

07:47.800 --> 07:48.700
isn't much of a fighter,

07:49.270 --> 07:49.980
and that's me.

07:51.800 --> 07:52.610
But now,

07:53.160 --> 07:54.780
something outrageous has happened.

07:55.190 --> 07:55.900
So I think

07:56.310 --> 07:57.580
we need the Guardians' help.

07:58.630 --> 07:59.340
There aren't several.

07:59.830 --> 08:00.460
Only this one left.

08:04.040 --> 08:04.540
What is it?

08:06.630 --> 08:07.660
What rotten luck!

08:07.800 --> 08:09.290
Why are you the one left?

08:23.040 --> 08:23.540
Muyu,

08:24.120 --> 08:24.810
you're awake.

08:35.870 --> 08:37.130
Why am I here?

08:38.720 --> 08:39.460
He-Yu Clinic

08:39.480 --> 08:40.370
is no longer safe.

08:41.380 --> 08:43.130
It'll be under watch from now on.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.940
So for now, we're hiding

08:44.960 --> 08:45.850
at Ms. Wan'er's place.

08:46.670 --> 08:48.130
Mr. Tu brought us here.

08:49.550 --> 08:50.580
It's Ms. Wan'er

08:51.030 --> 08:51.770
of Pleasure House?

08:52.720 --> 08:53.250
That's her.

08:54.200 --> 08:55.430
Mr. Tu also said

08:55.480 --> 08:56.460
Ms. Wan'er's place

08:56.870 --> 08:58.530
is the quietest in Tianqi City,

08:59.120 --> 09:00.530
so no one should disturb us.

09:02.150 --> 09:02.820
Good.

09:04.440 --> 09:05.340
How's the miracle physician?

09:12.360 --> 09:13.180
Zhaoyan says

09:13.200 --> 09:14.370
she's out of danger,

09:15.240 --> 09:16.530
but needs time

09:16.550 --> 09:17.530
to wake up.

09:18.600 --> 09:19.130
Xuewei,

09:20.360 --> 09:20.940
please escort her

09:21.240 --> 09:22.700
out of Tianqi City

09:23.030 --> 09:23.700
to Nan'an.

09:25.720 --> 09:26.130
No.

09:27.480 --> 09:28.650
No one can protect her in Nan'an now.

09:29.120 --> 09:29.820
Send her to Blood River.

09:30.670 --> 09:31.820
Uncle Zhe and Uncle Qidao are there.

09:35.360 --> 09:37.010
She's too weak now.

09:37.910 --> 09:39.650
If she leaves Tianqi for Blood River,

09:40.000 --> 09:41.170
the road is too long,

09:41.170 --> 09:42.220
she won't hold out.

09:43.480 --> 09:44.010
Muyu,

09:44.440 --> 09:45.250
don't worry.

09:45.870 --> 09:47.530
Yumo has sent word to Blood River.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.100
Uncle Zhe and Uncle Qidao

09:49.320 --> 09:50.700
will dispatch reinforcements to Tianqi.

09:51.790 --> 09:53.580
Then we're getting some serious reinforcements.

09:54.060 --> 09:56.360
[Good harvest this year. Next year, plant widely.]

09:56.360 --> 09:57.890
Back in the old Blood River,

09:59.510 --> 10:01.220
our intel

10:01.510 --> 10:03.180
always told us

10:03.510 --> 10:04.980
who would appear where.

10:05.960 --> 10:08.250
On which year, month, and day,

10:08.510 --> 10:10.770
some even picky enough

10:11.240 --> 10:12.920
to name the exact hour,

10:12.920 --> 10:13.820
to kill the target.

10:14.200 --> 10:16.250
Now the info I get

10:17.360 --> 10:18.420
is all about

10:19.000 --> 10:20.700
this year's yields

10:21.120 --> 10:22.730
and next year's planting plans.

10:23.750 --> 10:25.220
When did Blood River's broadswords

10:26.200 --> 10:28.700
turn into sickles for cutting wheat?

10:29.390 --> 10:31.130
Now our disciples have nothing to do,

10:31.630 --> 10:33.820
no place to spend their strength.

10:34.390 --> 10:35.390
So Master Su

10:35.480 --> 10:36.820
gave us these tasks.

10:37.390 --> 10:38.220
When they return

10:38.240 --> 10:39.490
from Tianqi City,

10:39.910 --> 10:40.890
we'll even be tested.

10:44.270 --> 10:45.250
Tested how?

10:46.150 --> 10:46.700
Anyone who fails

10:47.670 --> 10:48.490
is expelled from the Three Families.

10:48.670 --> 10:50.130
That's the toughest thing

10:50.600 --> 10:52.010
Su Muyu has said

10:52.080 --> 10:53.610
since becoming family head.

10:54.150 --> 10:55.580
Uncle Qidao, you know,

10:55.910 --> 10:57.130
Master Su

10:57.150 --> 10:58.180
is kind by nature.

10:58.790 --> 11:00.100
But when he gives his word,

11:00.480 --> 11:03.180
it's set in stone.

11:03.720 --> 11:04.980
Our Xie family's the strongest,

11:05.440 --> 11:06.340
so jobs like these

11:06.440 --> 11:07.490
are easy for us.

11:08.120 --> 11:10.770
The Su family... can manage too.

11:11.630 --> 11:12.650
The Mu family has it rough.

11:13.000 --> 11:14.770
They like things spotless and aren't strong.

11:15.080 --> 11:15.980
- I'm afraid... - Enough.

11:16.600 --> 11:17.060
Stand down.

11:18.270 --> 11:18.650
Yes, sir.

11:24.840 --> 11:25.490
Nice.

11:26.600 --> 11:27.370
Su Muyu

11:28.120 --> 11:29.490
has learned to tease people.

11:30.750 --> 11:31.820
I think

11:32.510 --> 11:34.100
he isn't teasing.

11:35.790 --> 11:37.420
He's serious.

11:37.840 --> 11:38.610
By the way,

11:38.670 --> 11:39.940
they had you stay

11:40.000 --> 11:41.610
to help me with Blood River affairs,

11:41.870 --> 11:42.820
but why didn't you...

11:43.120 --> 11:44.460
I can't farm.

11:44.960 --> 11:46.100
Why didn't you

11:46.120 --> 11:48.010
go to Tianqi with them?

11:50.600 --> 11:51.820
I'm just an old man.

11:52.440 --> 11:53.820
They're all young.

11:54.670 --> 11:55.530
Sometimes,

11:55.720 --> 11:56.940
having us elders around

11:57.270 --> 11:58.420
just gets in the way,

11:58.630 --> 11:59.130
you know.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.420
I don't.

12:05.000 --> 12:06.010
Then why didn't you go?

12:06.670 --> 12:07.010
I...

12:08.270 --> 12:09.580
Blood River is huge.

12:10.120 --> 12:11.490
Someone has to sit in command.

12:12.150 --> 12:13.700
Without a hand on them,

12:14.270 --> 12:15.730
they'll run wild.

12:17.390 --> 12:18.010
Big news!

12:19.360 --> 12:20.940
Master, big news!

12:21.240 --> 12:21.770
What is it?

12:22.550 --> 12:24.340
Wild boars raided the cabbages?

12:24.510 --> 12:24.890
No.

12:25.150 --> 12:26.010
Something happened in Tianqi.

12:42.540 --> 12:43.440
[He-Yu Clinic was attacked. Miracle Physician Bai was critically injured.]

12:43.440 --> 12:43.940
[Master Su stormed and nearly destroyed]

12:43.940 --> 12:44.540
[the Flying Tiger General's Residence.]

12:48.080 --> 12:50.180
Su Zhe, what are you doing?

12:50.720 --> 12:51.940
Flatten Tianqi!

13:08.240 --> 13:08.980
So it's you.

13:10.000 --> 13:10.820
You're...

13:11.910 --> 13:13.250
Mu Xuewei, Poisonous Blossom of the Mu family.

13:13.630 --> 13:14.530
Yumo's good friend.

13:15.480 --> 13:16.850
Too bad the poison in me

13:16.870 --> 13:17.770
has been purged.

13:18.270 --> 13:19.460
Otherwise, one palm from me

13:20.480 --> 13:21.340
and you'd be dead.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.340
Well,

13:25.600 --> 13:26.850
he's a genius of the Tang Clan.

13:27.080 --> 13:28.370
Your poisons are fierce.

13:28.790 --> 13:29.730
But to kill him,

13:29.870 --> 13:30.980
that's nowhere near enough.

13:34.080 --> 13:34.610
Let's go.

13:36.440 --> 13:36.850
Where to?

13:38.000 --> 13:38.530
I'd planned

13:38.720 --> 13:39.890
to wait until the miracle physician woke

13:40.080 --> 13:40.890
and ask her more.

13:41.150 --> 13:42.650
But who knows when she'll wake.

13:43.240 --> 13:43.890
So now,

13:44.080 --> 13:44.890
we can only investigate

13:44.910 --> 13:45.850
that rotten commander's son.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.650
I really hate Tianqi City.

13:47.910 --> 13:48.580
Let's move.

13:49.200 --> 13:50.250
To your Mount Wangcheng?

13:52.720 --> 13:53.700
So, are you...

13:54.840 --> 13:55.420
coming with us?

13:59.270 --> 14:00.460
They don't take women there.

14:04.200 --> 14:04.820
Xuanwu Guardian,

14:05.120 --> 14:06.730
let's split up then.

14:08.960 --> 14:09.940
Where's Su Muyu and the rest?

14:12.910 --> 14:13.610
He's hurt,

14:14.080 --> 14:15.250
so of course he's inside.

14:25.600 --> 14:26.180
Miss Yumo.

14:27.000 --> 14:27.850
What should I call you?

14:28.870 --> 14:29.710
Mr. Lianyue?

14:33.510 --> 14:35.180
Sounds like quite the perfect match.

14:37.550 --> 14:38.490
Now's not the time...

14:38.510 --> 14:39.940
Now's not the time for this,

14:41.200 --> 14:41.650
huh?

14:45.150 --> 14:46.220
Then when is it?

14:47.320 --> 14:47.890
Tomorrow?

14:48.790 --> 14:49.340
The day after?

14:51.240 --> 14:52.100
Or in the next life?

14:53.940 --> 14:58.420
♪Thoughts that never fade, year after year gazing from afar...♪

14:58.870 --> 14:59.850
I'll only ask once.

15:01.030 --> 15:01.650
In your heart,

15:02.870 --> 15:03.580
am I there?

15:04.840 --> 15:05.730
Since we parted at the Tang Clan,

15:07.910 --> 15:09.250
I often think of you.

15:10.270 --> 15:10.650
Good.

15:12.080 --> 15:13.700
Then why never come find me?

15:16.120 --> 15:17.820
I've been tracking my senior's trail.

15:21.790 --> 15:22.490
Let me ask you again:

15:23.750 --> 15:24.730
If your senior

15:24.750 --> 15:25.700
is safely rescued,

15:27.790 --> 15:29.100
will you come to Blood River to marry me?

15:40.000 --> 15:41.200
I'm a Tang Clan disciple

15:42.390 --> 15:43.850
and Tianqi City's Xuanwu Guardian.

15:46.030 --> 15:47.220
If I go to Blood River to propose,

15:48.550 --> 15:49.730
the grand master won't agree.

15:52.720 --> 15:53.250
And His Highness would likely...

15:53.270 --> 15:54.180
I'm asking

15:54.240 --> 15:54.940
if I'm in your heart.

15:57.910 --> 15:59.010
Did I ask about the Tang Clan?

16:00.320 --> 16:01.370
Or the Prince of Langya's Manor?

16:11.390 --> 16:11.820
Enough.

16:12.630 --> 16:13.180
I understand.

16:16.910 --> 16:17.530
Miss Yumo...

16:19.600 --> 16:20.730
- I didn't mean... - It's fine.

16:22.390 --> 16:23.130
I'm happy.

16:23.960 --> 16:24.460
At least...

16:25.480 --> 16:26.890
now I know I'm in your heart.

16:30.910 --> 16:31.940
But I'm also sad.

16:31.940 --> 16:37.380
♪Do not long for the sorrow of separation...♪

16:37.390 --> 16:38.180
I didn't expect

16:39.550 --> 16:40.250
that in your mind,

16:40.270 --> 16:41.610
Blood River ranks like this.

16:44.240 --> 16:45.940
Is liking a woman of Blood River

16:47.150 --> 16:48.580
so shameful?

16:49.200 --> 16:50.100
That's not what I mean.

16:51.480 --> 16:52.940
I've asked what I needed.

16:53.790 --> 16:54.460
From here on,

16:55.320 --> 16:56.650
we're partners in action.

16:57.600 --> 16:58.370
As for you senior,

16:58.840 --> 16:59.980
we'll help rescue him.

17:01.080 --> 17:02.890
And for Muyu and the miracle physician,

17:03.720 --> 17:04.730
we will have justice.

17:06.640 --> 17:07.180
Let's go.

17:08.740 --> 17:16.020
♪May this life leave no regrets♪

17:26.160 --> 17:26.940
I'll leave you to talk.

17:28.110 --> 17:29.090
Thank you, Ms. Wan'er.

17:34.960 --> 17:35.330
Have a seat.

17:43.440 --> 17:44.090
Mr. Su,

17:44.920 --> 17:46.460
seems you're badly hurt.

17:47.160 --> 17:47.940
I'll need a few days' rest.

17:49.270 --> 17:50.140
I've been in Blood River for years.

17:50.920 --> 17:52.050
Worse wounds than this

17:52.720 --> 17:54.220
used to be routine.

17:55.270 --> 17:56.730
Still, my thanks to you.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.570
Without your care,

17:59.160 --> 18:00.290
we'd likely be fleeing

18:00.350 --> 18:01.620
from Tianqi City by now.

18:02.640 --> 18:03.700
Leaving now

18:04.270 --> 18:05.090
wouldn't be a bad idea.

18:06.030 --> 18:07.010
Now that we're in the thick of it,

18:07.720 --> 18:08.730
we'll fight to the death,

18:09.160 --> 18:09.810
no more hesitation.

18:10.960 --> 18:11.700
That's our choice

18:11.750 --> 18:12.570
for Blood River.

18:15.030 --> 18:15.490
Very well.

18:16.550 --> 18:17.900
Since I got back,

18:18.240 --> 18:18.980
I've been tracking

18:19.000 --> 18:20.460
General Li Xian's son.

18:21.310 --> 18:22.140
I found

18:22.400 --> 18:23.180
something seriously off.

18:23.750 --> 18:24.940
Yumo already started digging

18:24.950 --> 18:25.810
based on the lead

18:25.880 --> 18:26.660
you gave me.

18:27.480 --> 18:28.460
Now it seems

18:29.920 --> 18:31.640
you've found more?

18:32.100 --> 18:32.710
Yes.

18:34.270 --> 18:35.810
General Li Xian is brave,

18:36.310 --> 18:37.050
but his son

18:37.070 --> 18:38.420
is not much good at martial arts.

18:38.830 --> 18:39.860
He's past twenty

18:40.270 --> 18:41.770
and still hasn't made deputy general.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.580
Before,

18:43.580 --> 18:44.330
a deputy commander

18:44.350 --> 18:45.570
could easily get his son

18:45.640 --> 18:46.490
promoted.

18:46.750 --> 18:48.250
But with the Prince of Langya now,

18:48.720 --> 18:50.330
everything must be fair.

18:51.480 --> 18:52.570
In fifteen days,

18:52.880 --> 18:54.290
the Golden Throne Contest begins.

18:54.830 --> 18:56.900
If he can rack up three straight wins,

18:57.160 --> 18:58.660
he will be appointed deputy general.

18:59.750 --> 19:00.700
Can every Jinwu Guard join

19:01.720 --> 19:03.530
the Golden Throne Contest?

19:04.400 --> 19:05.050
Of course not.

19:06.110 --> 19:07.770
To enter the contest,

19:08.110 --> 19:09.330
you must first clear

19:09.350 --> 19:10.290
the Jinwu Guards' prelims.

19:10.680 --> 19:12.620
Only forty-eight make the cut.

19:13.270 --> 19:14.250
General Li Xian's son

19:14.310 --> 19:15.330
couldn't even pass

19:15.350 --> 19:16.250
the prelims at first.

19:16.590 --> 19:17.730
But ten days ago,

19:17.960 --> 19:19.900
he stunned everyone in the prelims,

19:20.030 --> 19:22.250
earning a direct slot for the contest.

19:22.880 --> 19:23.860
Soon after,

19:24.240 --> 19:26.140
news spread he fell ill.

19:27.310 --> 19:28.900
So, in that window,

19:30.030 --> 19:31.250
he used some method

19:31.310 --> 19:32.570
to boost his power,

19:33.510 --> 19:34.460
most likely...

19:35.640 --> 19:37.250
the drugged puppet art.

19:38.030 --> 19:39.870
It can indeed boost one's power

19:39.870 --> 19:41.010
for a short time.

19:41.960 --> 19:43.770
But the general's boy likely didn't know

19:43.830 --> 19:44.700
about the backlash.

19:45.510 --> 19:46.700
He was probably set up.

19:47.590 --> 19:49.460
So I traced his movements.

19:49.960 --> 19:51.250
I found that a month ago,

19:51.400 --> 19:53.810
he kept visiting Doom Abyss in the Ghost Market.

19:54.680 --> 19:55.420
The Ghost Market

19:55.440 --> 19:56.940
is actually just Tianqi's

19:57.070 --> 19:59.050
best-known black market,

19:59.350 --> 20:00.660
a mixed crowd,

20:00.920 --> 20:02.770
a gray zone at best.

20:03.550 --> 20:05.380
Without connections, you can't get in.

20:05.720 --> 20:06.730
Even its hours

20:06.750 --> 20:07.860
are hard to catch.

20:08.920 --> 20:09.460
However,

20:10.440 --> 20:11.220
as far as I know,

20:11.920 --> 20:14.180
it opens once today.

20:16.750 --> 20:17.180
Good.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.570
Notify Xuewei now.

20:27.220 --> 20:28.070
Bravo!

20:40.110 --> 20:41.050
Since entering Tianqi,

20:41.270 --> 20:42.420
I've wanted to see the Ghost Market.

20:43.160 --> 20:45.250
They say it's a place of monsters and ghosts.

20:45.590 --> 20:47.010
I wonder how it compares to Blood River.

20:47.440 --> 20:48.900
Didn't expect this wish

20:48.920 --> 20:49.660
would come true today.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.700
What a coincidence.

20:52.070 --> 20:53.420
All I've ever wanted

20:53.640 --> 20:54.700
was to take you here.

20:55.270 --> 20:56.570
Then why not sooner?

20:56.960 --> 20:58.220
Now we need someone else to bring us in.

21:00.030 --> 21:01.570
After all, we're strangers

21:01.640 --> 21:02.490
in Tianqi.

21:02.880 --> 21:04.050
We need the right connections.

21:05.350 --> 21:06.090
Am I right,

21:06.400 --> 21:07.010
Xuanwu Guardian?

21:19.720 --> 21:20.140
Yumo,

21:20.480 --> 21:21.140
I'll go with you!

21:22.590 --> 21:23.530
Hey, that's not how we're grouped!

21:26.510 --> 21:27.420
Looks like, same as me,

21:28.200 --> 21:29.250
you're not very welcome.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.770
Who's like you?

21:35.680 --> 21:36.250
Everyone,

21:37.810 --> 21:39.170
long time no see.

21:45.200 --> 21:45.980
Try some snacks.

21:56.510 --> 21:57.220
One for me.

21:57.640 --> 21:58.290
Me too.

22:00.340 --> 22:01.270
- Thanks. - Much obliged.

22:06.310 --> 22:07.160
That's it!

22:07.920 --> 22:08.620
Not bad!

22:17.440 --> 22:18.220
Recently,

22:18.510 --> 22:20.140
Li Zhengqi passed the Golden Throne prelims,

22:20.400 --> 22:21.490
then soon fell ill.

22:21.920 --> 22:22.460
A friend of mine

22:22.830 --> 22:23.700
works at their manor.

22:24.000 --> 22:25.090
He says he's gone mad.

22:26.720 --> 22:29.090
Are these pills really safe to take?

22:29.600 --> 22:31.170
Of course.

22:33.720 --> 22:35.460
Take one after every two meals,

22:36.240 --> 22:37.250
ten pills in a row.

22:37.830 --> 22:39.100
In fifteen days,

22:39.170 --> 22:40.480
your body will be

22:40.510 --> 22:42.500
as good as reborn.

22:43.310 --> 22:45.140
Forget the Golden Throne Contest,

22:46.400 --> 22:48.090
you might even win first place

22:48.200 --> 22:50.940
in next year's martial exam.

22:52.510 --> 22:53.140
That magical?

22:53.720 --> 22:55.460
Then why did he end up like that?

22:57.880 --> 22:58.770
Because...

23:00.000 --> 23:01.330
he rushed it.

23:02.750 --> 23:04.620
He feared he'd fail the prelims

23:05.400 --> 23:07.660
and downed all three pills I gave him

23:07.720 --> 23:10.090
on the eve of the bout.

23:13.960 --> 23:14.940
Even so, today,

23:15.880 --> 23:17.730
I'll give each of you five pills.

23:19.030 --> 23:19.900
I hope you all

23:20.720 --> 23:23.220
won't do anything that stupid.

23:24.500 --> 23:25.710
- Of course not. - Never.

23:31.140 --> 23:32.470
This time it's in the bag.

23:32.470 --> 23:33.060
Yeah.

23:36.000 --> 23:37.730
With this, the martial exam's nothing.

23:37.730 --> 23:38.710
- Yeah. - Yeah.

23:40.230 --> 23:41.130
Great.

23:48.790 --> 23:50.860
How did Sikong Changfeng rope you in?

23:52.200 --> 23:53.010
Since you're here,

23:53.550 --> 23:54.700
why not a rematch?

23:56.750 --> 23:58.250
A true lady stays silent

23:58.510 --> 23:59.290
when others are reading.

24:00.270 --> 24:01.490
He says there's a tough endgame

24:01.750 --> 24:02.660
and asked me to take a look.

24:04.790 --> 24:06.220
A fine game indeed.

24:07.310 --> 24:08.330
So I seek answers in the books.

24:09.200 --> 24:09.900
Nonsense.

24:22.380 --> 24:23.280
[Your father's in peril on Mount Luolei. I'm heading there.]

24:23.280 --> 24:23.940
[Tianqi City is in turmoil.]

24:23.940 --> 24:25.140
[If a Sword Deity lends aid, I'll rest easy. Please help.]

24:28.110 --> 24:28.570
What is it?

24:30.400 --> 24:32.010
I thought at your Xueyue City,

24:32.030 --> 24:32.770
atop Mount Cang,

24:33.070 --> 24:34.330
nothing worldly would trouble the heart.

24:35.830 --> 24:36.900
Seems as long as we live,

24:37.510 --> 24:38.380
wherever we flee,

24:39.270 --> 24:40.420
we can't escape being disturbed.

24:44.110 --> 24:45.530
My mother left Tianqi

24:45.790 --> 24:46.730
to aid my father.

24:47.590 --> 24:48.330
The Prince of Langya

24:48.880 --> 24:50.030
is in poor health

24:50.640 --> 24:51.900
and may have no guards at hand.

24:52.440 --> 24:54.180
So you're heading to Tianqi?

24:55.880 --> 24:57.420
I don't like that city,

24:58.160 --> 25:00.010
but it seems I have to go.

25:03.920 --> 25:05.780
My mother wrote

25:06.070 --> 25:07.380
that with a Sword Deity's help,

25:07.640 --> 25:08.850
she'd have no worries.

25:09.400 --> 25:10.660
- So, will you... - Hold.

25:12.400 --> 25:12.940
Say no more.

25:15.970 --> 25:17.240
In literary terms,

25:17.350 --> 25:18.660
your mother's letter is just flowery praise.

25:19.680 --> 25:20.620
In the end,

25:20.640 --> 25:21.490
it was meant to move you.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.570
Let's make a bet.

25:25.750 --> 25:26.660
If I win,

25:27.030 --> 25:28.090
you'll go to Tianqi.

25:28.550 --> 25:30.380
I'll lend you the Luoshui City Lord's collection

25:30.400 --> 25:31.290
to read.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.250
If I lose,

25:34.920 --> 25:35.900
I'll go instead

25:36.750 --> 25:37.660
and take up my mother's charge.

25:40.790 --> 25:41.220
Bet on what?

25:44.270 --> 25:45.380
How about plucking leaves with sword energy?

25:47.640 --> 25:48.770
Mount Cang has plenty of flowers.

25:49.270 --> 25:50.380
Let's see,

25:50.880 --> 25:51.810
within one stick of incense,

25:52.310 --> 25:53.010
how many petals

25:53.030 --> 25:54.330
we each can pluck.

25:54.920 --> 25:55.940
Most wins.

26:58.440 --> 26:59.900
So I'm alive after all.

27:13.310 --> 27:13.810
Miracle physician,

27:14.310 --> 27:14.860
you're awake!

27:17.720 --> 27:18.180
Have a seat.

27:29.960 --> 27:31.090
Your wounds are grave.

27:31.960 --> 27:32.700
Don't move around.

27:33.270 --> 27:34.180
Look at you...

27:34.720 --> 27:36.140
Are you the miracle physician or am I?

27:44.640 --> 27:45.330
Master!

27:46.030 --> 27:47.140
How can you be out of bed?

27:47.310 --> 27:48.090
Take care of yourself!

27:48.720 --> 27:50.180
Are you the master or am I?

27:51.070 --> 27:52.730
You're all talking

27:53.350 --> 27:54.290
awfully bold today.

27:54.920 --> 27:55.570
Master,

27:56.030 --> 27:56.860
you're almost dead

27:57.110 --> 27:57.940
and still bragging.

27:59.720 --> 28:00.460
Please drink your medicine.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.250
Did you treat

28:03.640 --> 28:04.490
my wounds,

28:04.720 --> 28:05.140
Zhaoyan?

28:07.640 --> 28:08.250
Just now,

28:08.480 --> 28:09.490
I felt the wound.

28:09.960 --> 28:10.770
The bandaging

28:11.310 --> 28:12.330
could use some improvement.

28:15.720 --> 28:16.530
I am lacking.

28:17.960 --> 28:19.220
Don't say that.

28:19.720 --> 28:20.730
When I was hit,

28:21.110 --> 28:22.460
I thought I was done for.

28:22.920 --> 28:24.490
In Tianqi City,

28:24.790 --> 28:26.980
finding a physician to fix this

28:27.200 --> 28:28.050
isn't easy.

28:30.720 --> 28:31.490
You're impressive!

28:52.830 --> 28:53.330
You...

28:54.200 --> 28:54.860
Give me your hand.

29:10.790 --> 29:11.330
Master,

29:11.880 --> 29:12.870
to draw those experts away

29:12.880 --> 29:13.900
and safeguard us,

29:14.160 --> 29:15.570
Muyu stormed the grand general's manor

29:16.030 --> 29:17.180
and suffered severe internal injuries.

29:18.400 --> 29:18.980
Lately,

29:19.000 --> 29:19.810
he's been recovering.

29:20.510 --> 29:21.490
I prescribed some medicine,

29:21.880 --> 29:23.220
but I'm not sure if it's right.

29:23.920 --> 29:25.220
Master, will you take a look?

29:28.880 --> 29:30.220
It's not about internal injuries.

29:34.110 --> 29:35.730
I trust your work.

29:36.400 --> 29:37.180
Treating internal wounds

29:37.440 --> 29:38.940
was the first thing I taught you.

29:39.720 --> 29:41.090
If even that goes wrong,

29:41.680 --> 29:43.330
you'd be expelled from Medicine King Valley.

29:46.720 --> 29:47.140
All right,

29:47.830 --> 29:48.570
I should rest.

29:49.160 --> 29:49.810
You may go out.

29:56.400 --> 29:57.180
Master,

29:58.000 --> 30:00.000
we're staying at Ms. Wan'er's place now.

30:00.200 --> 30:01.140
Thing is,

30:01.350 --> 30:02.380
there aren't many rooms.

30:02.880 --> 30:04.050
All patients have to stay here.

30:04.720 --> 30:05.900
Muyu needs rest too.

30:06.310 --> 30:07.530
So he...

30:08.640 --> 30:09.730
has to sleep here as well.

30:16.200 --> 30:17.860
Where... will he sleep?

30:18.350 --> 30:19.090
He'll sleep...

30:19.830 --> 30:20.810
in the next room.

30:28.030 --> 30:29.250
You may step out now.

30:55.550 --> 30:56.490
Su Muyu,

30:57.400 --> 30:57.980
are you...

30:58.400 --> 31:00.050
hiding something from me?

31:03.270 --> 31:04.140
You're no longer

31:04.160 --> 31:05.090
Blood River's Kui,

31:05.880 --> 31:07.180
nor a wandering ghost

31:07.200 --> 31:08.090
of No-Sword City.

31:08.790 --> 31:09.770
Whatever it is,

31:10.720 --> 31:11.380
you can

31:12.110 --> 31:13.090
and should tell me.

31:14.480 --> 31:16.140
When I took your pulse,

31:16.400 --> 31:17.530
I found

31:18.070 --> 31:19.900
you could go into deviation at any time.

31:20.550 --> 31:21.250
Do you realize that?

31:25.350 --> 31:26.770
As expected, I can't hide it from you.

31:27.830 --> 31:28.860
Was it to save me

31:29.680 --> 31:30.570
that you did this?

31:31.400 --> 31:32.050
I promised

31:32.920 --> 31:33.900
to keep you safe.

31:34.960 --> 31:35.570
That promise

31:35.750 --> 31:37.570
was back in Jiuxiao City.

31:38.750 --> 31:39.290
Is that so?

31:42.790 --> 31:43.810
I thought that promise

31:45.070 --> 31:45.980
still stood.

31:47.000 --> 31:48.770
You're in real danger now.

31:49.350 --> 31:50.420
In Wushuang City,

31:50.960 --> 31:51.570
we all saw

31:51.590 --> 31:52.530
Jian Wudi's state.

31:53.240 --> 31:54.050
Once in deviation,

31:54.550 --> 31:55.380
power may surge,

31:56.200 --> 31:58.180
but it burns one's life away.

31:58.830 --> 31:59.530
Don't worry.

32:00.030 --> 32:00.860
I know my limits.

32:01.680 --> 32:02.530
I won't let myself

32:02.640 --> 32:03.700
reach that point.

32:04.960 --> 32:05.660
However,

32:06.880 --> 32:08.090
about my condition,

32:09.350 --> 32:10.700
please don't tell Yumo and the others.

32:11.240 --> 32:13.180
Things are perilous enough,

32:13.960 --> 32:15.420
no need to worry them.

32:16.310 --> 32:16.770
All right.

32:18.110 --> 32:18.770
But Su Muyu,

32:20.550 --> 32:21.980
remember this...

32:24.510 --> 32:25.460
no bravado.

32:27.790 --> 32:28.380
Of course no.

32:49.270 --> 32:50.700
The Mu family's messenger butterfly

32:51.310 --> 32:52.330
is exquisitely made.

32:56.100 --> 32:57.200
[Qingyang, Xuewei, Yumo, and the Xuanwu Guardian]

32:57.200 --> 32:58.300
[are investigating the Ghost Market. Note from Su Muyu]

33:02.240 --> 33:02.770
Looks like

33:03.270 --> 33:04.490
I judged him right.

33:05.510 --> 33:07.220
This head of Blood River's Su family

33:07.480 --> 33:09.180
is worthy of trust.

33:10.350 --> 33:10.860
Then,

33:11.830 --> 33:12.660
it's time

33:13.110 --> 33:14.730
to see them again.

33:16.960 --> 33:17.330
All right.

33:17.350 --> 33:18.010
Let's go.

33:18.030 --> 33:18.730
- Let's go. - Let's go.

33:20.790 --> 33:21.490
Keep the pills safe.

33:25.750 --> 33:27.490
- My pills! - My pills!

33:30.480 --> 33:30.860
Who's there?

33:38.350 --> 33:40.250
Xuanwu Guardian Tang Lianyue!

33:41.440 --> 33:42.380
- Move! - Move!

33:42.480 --> 33:43.380
No one runs!

33:46.070 --> 33:47.050
I hear in Tianqi City,

33:47.070 --> 33:48.090
when the Four Guardians handle a case,

33:48.510 --> 33:50.220
even the grand chancellor must cooperate.

33:50.790 --> 33:52.010
Gentlemen, didn't you hear him?

33:52.750 --> 33:53.860
No one leaves.

33:54.160 --> 33:55.140
Get them! Go!

33:55.160 --> 33:56.420
- Go! - Go!

33:59.440 --> 34:00.250
Don't kill them.

34:01.030 --> 34:02.290
That's a bit hard.

34:02.550 --> 34:03.270
Move!

34:05.680 --> 34:06.770
Quit staring! Move!

34:07.310 --> 34:08.090
Hurry!

34:08.210 --> 34:08.870
Leave it!

34:08.980 --> 34:09.570
This way!

34:09.670 --> 34:10.180
Quick!

34:11.710 --> 34:12.780
What are you waiting for?

34:14.880 --> 34:15.530
Are you just watching?

34:24.710 --> 34:26.010
Winds howl, the longbow sings.

34:26.590 --> 34:27.860
A general rides the killing field.

34:28.400 --> 34:29.490
Facing you

34:29.550 --> 34:30.260
on the battlefield,

34:30.920 --> 34:32.170
I'd fear you some.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.020
But within this space,

34:34.840 --> 34:36.900
let's see if my Tang Clan's hidden weapons

34:37.630 --> 34:38.940
are faster than your arrows!

34:41.190 --> 34:41.690
Watch out!

34:47.510 --> 34:48.050
Senior!

34:52.440 --> 34:53.570
What "senior"?

34:53.920 --> 34:55.420
He's here to take your life!

35:03.800 --> 35:04.170
Tang Lianyue!

35:04.630 --> 35:05.340
Don't touch him!

35:09.620 --> 35:13.100
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:13.140 --> 35:17.020
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:18.860 --> 35:22.340
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:22.380 --> 35:26.220
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:28.220 --> 35:31.500
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:31.620 --> 35:33.700
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:33.860 --> 35:37.300
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:37.780 --> 35:39.980
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:40.100 --> 35:45.100
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:01.700 --> 36:05.420
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:05.540 --> 36:09.620
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:10.860 --> 36:14.740
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:14.860 --> 36:19.100
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:20.220 --> 36:23.100
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:23.180 --> 36:27.420
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:29.700 --> 36:33.700
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:33.740 --> 36:37.180
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

36:38.700 --> 36:42.140
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:42.220 --> 36:46.020
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:47.940 --> 36:51.380
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:51.420 --> 36:55.260
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

36:57.300 --> 37:00.540
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

37:00.660 --> 37:02.740
♪Still I can't let go♪

37:02.940 --> 37:06.340
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

37:06.820 --> 37:09.020
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:09.100 --> 37:14.140
♪No one can escape from love♪

37:21.500 --> 37:23.700
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:23.780 --> 37:28.820
♪No one can escape from love♪
